      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Some covens whisper of a buried heart distinct from the true **Curse of Blight**. The older curse travels outward through flesh and field; this forbidden working would root one persistent Heart in nearby soil.[#]()",
      "title": "Rite of the Blight Heart",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)By default the buried heart lies sealed and takes neither offering nor altar power. Where unsealed, each witch may sustain only one Heart, and two Hearts cannot root close together.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "witchery:station_recipe",
