    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Where the seal has been lifted, activate the complete medium Infernal circle while all seven offerings are present. The Poisonous Potato distinguishes this rite from the original curse's Glistering Melon Slice.[#]()",
      "title": "The Working",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)If no permitted root can be found, or another Heart already answers to the witch, nothing is consumed. The Heart spreads only while its witch is present in that world and remembers every changed block.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Use a Seer Stone on the stain to feel the root's direction. Break or cleanse the Heart and loaded land returns to the blocks it held before the corruption.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    }
